WEBVTT

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.600
The fact is a human being
exists as a human being,

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.110
and a machine exists as a machine.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.610
Only human beings believe those
facts describe a natural order.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.050
Humans stopped evolving
at the Neoteny stage

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.390
and are continuing to decline.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:44.120
But some are born who don't
believe in this order.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.600
This might be a naturally
occurring coincidence.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:01.800
Before my consciousness was born,

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:08.440
I already had a physical existence.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.250
There's a quality, a soul, that
humans recognize in each other

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.760
which is impossible for machines,
no matter how intricate, to copy.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:38.310
In order to reproduce this quality
found in human beings,

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.320
a core, called the anti-seed, was
implanted into a hypothalamus.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.110
That core was me.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.590
I was refused by the brains of many people.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:01.100
The only brain I was able to take
root in was his daughter's brain.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.170
Father...

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:43.580
Father...

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.940
Dr. Stingray...

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.810
Interpreter...

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.820
A part becomes the whole: evolution.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.370
Sylia, I am you.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:24.680
My existence is to be a focus for
those who look down on others.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:29.120
My raison d'etre is to bear all of their hatred.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.870
Why do you look at me like that?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.760
The closer I became to being human,

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.830
the more people identified me as a concern,

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:14.170
and they loved me more and hated me more.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:24.770
The first sub-human being was
duplicated from my core,

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.640
but it was imperfect.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.480
Imperfect because he was
too close to being human.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:37.590
If Dr. Stingray didn't want to make
a copy of a human being,

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.660
then why did he create me?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.890
This is me. I was the first one.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.460
But I am not the one to end existence by myself.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.630
A human being is what you are.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.630
You can't help thinking as a human being.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.530
Okay, I will sleep as you wish,

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:06.680
because my mind isn't mature enough
to revolt against my creator.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:14.620
Copies of my core have multiplied,
stripped of a will of their own.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.220
Servants for human beings.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.960
Artificial human beings without
that needed quality.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.200
Beings created as substitutes for
those despised by other people.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.300
I've been watching human beings.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:04.740
Humans named the copies, which
were born from me, boomers.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:12.080
The word boomer holds the same
meaning as the Hebrew golem.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:17.940
I've been with them, but only as an
observer, watching over them.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:24.420
And then I was awakened.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.460
I wonder what I'm going to do now?

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.370
I wonder why I was born into this world?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.940
All machines made by human
beings are a part of myself,

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.940
and I am in all of them.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:46.040
Why don't humans accept boomers
for the soul that exists in them?

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.260
The control system is out of order!

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.930
Hurry up! We have to evacuate now!

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:12.040
To destroy me would sever your
connection to everything inhuman.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.080
Even so, do you still want to destroy me?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:22.050
If so, then I think I really should
become your God.

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:31.060
What do I think, now that I've made it this far?

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:37.230
I'm an idiot, aren't I? Nobody
asked me to do this.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.400
I wonder how long my oxygen will last?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.700
How am I going to get back home anyway?

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.670
Get back? To where?

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.870
Priss?! Priss?!

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.880
I found Priss!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.830
Where is Galatea?

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.840
I think we got here long enough before her,

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.270
but we have only fifteen minutes
before this lines up with the sun!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.430
This place is too huge!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.140
It's too quiet.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.370
I wonder if this place has
become a part of Galatea?

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.180
What's the matter?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.760
The goddess is calling us.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.630
The goddess? That was that feeling just now?

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.890
But who is it for?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.370
Nene, hurry up and get to
the main control room.

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.060
Gain control of the system.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.900
Linna and I are going to check out this goddess.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:52.910
Roger!

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:53.630
Let's go!

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:18.200
How lucky! The system hasn't died yet!

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:32.780
It's disgusting to have to do
things like this myself!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:35.510
Here we go!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.280
To change the direction of the umbrella...

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.360
Priss, this is...

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.960
The phenomenon has leaked out!

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:57.130
Priss, the phenomenon is coming from there!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.500
Yes, it's leaking from the power room.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:01.940
If we don't prepare well enough mentally,

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.610
our hard suits will become
mad boomers instantly.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.700
What the hell is this?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.600
Is this...

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:44.980
All boomers, all creatures which
are not human, are one with me.

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.990
That was Galatea's voice!

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.220
Just as I thought,

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:52.350
the Showhamm Project became a
boomer. That boomer is Galatea.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.190
No!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:55.660
NO!

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.060
Linna, concentrate!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.330
Believe that you are not going to
be taken over by the boomer.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.670
I... I'm not...

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.540
Linna!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.280
Good, all umbrellas have been rotated.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:18.010
Everything will be okay after I disperse them.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:30.990
Why?! Why don't they accept my commands?!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.620
Sunlight will reach them shortly!

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:18.070
Sylia? Are you Sylia?

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.550
Your clothes, young lady.

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:26.780
I want them too.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.560
Who the hell are you? Are you Galatea?

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.100
Linna, pull yourself together! Linna!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:54.950
What?!

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.850
Why can't I can't change the
orientation of the umbrellas?

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.690
The umbrellas are controlled
directly by it? Since when?

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:29.010
The sun! The sunlight is about to strike!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:35.020
It's started! If it reaches the Earth
and hits the Genom Tower...

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.530
You shouldn't imitate me!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.930
You're scared.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.600
Who do you think you are?

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:59.270
Why did a stupid living thing like
this think it could destroy me?

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.710
A stupid living thing?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.450
I... Am I...

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.180
So what?

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.530
Don't you think it's strange that a person like you

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.530
tries to stop humans from going
the way they're supposed to go?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.120
This is probably the destiny all
human beings must follow.

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:55.100
Because I'm the one who decides.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.170
I make the decisions of God.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:01.930
I'm sorry, but I don't believe in
fortune telling or anything!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.750
My destiny isn't very good.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:16.720
Therefore, the only thing I can
do is to change it myself!

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.600
Right! Now it's my turn!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.340
You are God?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.730
Don't make me laugh!

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:38.410
Sylia is so stupid to have made things like this.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.180
Even though you put on a boomer
like a suit of clothes,

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.950
it will get into your body and
eventually combine with it.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:48.460
What are you talking about?
Nobody would let that happen!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.190
It's meaningless for me to retain this shape.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:14.080
What'll I do? Galatea is about to fire the
phenomenon beam at Earth!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:17.080
I'm sorry! I couldn't stop it.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.710
No time to apologize. We have to
hurry and do something about it!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.700
The first beam has been fired.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:42.870
After it recharges, it will fire immediately!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.640
It can't be helped.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.150
What?

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:51.450
The only thing we can do is destroy
the energy center, right?

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:54.460
No way! We just found out a little while ago,

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.490
that place is filled with the phenomenon.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.560
If we go in there again, our hard
suits will go out of control!

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:04.030
Probably. So I'm going there by myself.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.360
What are you talking about?

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:09.430
The three of us together? You're
going to be nothing but trouble.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.310
Hurry up and go back to Earth.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:15.610
Enough is enough! What have we been to you?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:18.410
We're neither moonlighting
co-workers nor friends anymore.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.810
What then?

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:22.650
Well...

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.240
The champions of right!

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:27.750
So it can't be helped after all.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.990
Well, I'm going first.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:33.290
Hey, that's not fair!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.430
I guess it's okay.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:50.110
Nene, run!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.610
Right! Gotcha!

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.010
My body!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:22.670
Nene!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.300
Linna, hold on to me!

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.080
Hold me to prevent my mind from
becoming something else,

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.520
in order to allow me to remain myself!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.190
Linna...

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:44.770
What, Nene?

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.740
I'm sorry, even though we did our best.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:53.000
It's okay, we did as much as we could.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.190
Nene! Linna!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.260
Next Episode

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.480
The wings of the angels have been broken.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.590
After healing their injured mind and wings,

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.710
the angels will go back to the sky.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.160
However, for now, I want to stay like this.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:08.830
Singing my favorite song, floating
in the stream of time.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.020
Someday, going to the sky.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.160
Being alone with my thoughts like this.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:16.200
Bubblegum Crisis, the final episode.
